Kiln Linux: PyTorch 2.15.0 names an event type that Gentoo's Kineto 0.4.0_p20260805
does not have, so it does not compile. Kineto cannot produce that event, so remove the
one reference. Drop this patch when Gentoo's Kineto catches up.

--- a/torch/csrc/profiler/kineto_shim.cpp
+++ b/torch/csrc/profiler/kineto_shim.cpp
@@ -549,7 +549,6 @@
       [[fallthrough]];
     case libkineto::ActivityType::CUDA_SYNC:
     case libkineto::ActivityType::CUDA_PROFILER_RANGE:
-    case libkineto::ActivityType::HARDWARE_COUNTERS:
       return device_type_privateuse1_or(c10::DeviceType::CUDA);
